            "paragraph": "However, in some models increased seasonal amplitude is seen beyond the outer edge of the oligotrophic gyres, i.e. in a band south of the gyre edge in the Southern Ocean, northwest of the North Pacific and North Atlantic gyres and equatorward of the gyre boundary in the Pacific upwelling region.",
